---
// Demonstrates proportional line-height: as font size increases, line-height must decrease.
// Applying a uniform line-height multiplier across both headlines and body text is a major design bug.
---

<figure class="prl">
  <div class="prl-grid">
    <!-- Headline with Loose Leading (Wrong) -->
    <div class="prl-card is-wrong">
      <div class="prl-header">
        <span class="prl-badge prl-badge-wrong">
          <span data-lang-en>Headline with body leading (loose)</span>
          <span data-lang-vi>Tiêu đề dùng line-height rộng (lỗi)</span>
        </span>
        <code>text-2xl leading-loose (1.75)</code>
      </div>
      <div class="prl-box">
        <h3 class="prl-h3 prl-lead-loose">
          <span data-lang-en>High-throughput Event Streaming Architecture</span>
          <span data-lang-vi>Kiến trúc Streaming Xử lý Lưu lượng Cao</span>
        </h3>
      </div>
      <p class="prl-desc">
        <span data-lang-en>At 28px, a 1.75 line-height inserts 21px gaps between lines. The lines look like separate, disconnected fragments instead of one headline.</span>
        <span data-lang-vi>Ở cỡ 28px, line-height 1.75 tạo khoảng hở 21px giữa các dòng. Các dòng trông như những mảnh rời rạc thay vì một tiêu đề thống nhất.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline with Tight Leading (Correct) -->
    <div class="prl-card is-correct">
      <div class="prl-header">
        <span class="prl-badge prl-badge-correct">
          <span data-lang-en>Headline with proportional leading</span>
          <span data-lang-vi>Tiêu đề dùng line-height chuẩn (~1.15)</span>
        </span>
        <code>text-2xl leading-tight (1.15)</code>
      </div>
      <div class="prl-box">
        <h3 class="prl-h3 prl-lead-tight">
          <span data-lang-en>High-throughput Event Streaming Architecture</span>
          <span data-lang-vi>Kiến trúc Streaming Xử lý Lưu lượng Cao</span>
        </h3>
      </div>
      <p class="prl-desc">
        <span data-lang-en>At 28px, a 1.15 line-height keeps lines closely grouped. The Gestalt law of proximity binds them into a single mental unit.</span>
        <span data-lang-vi>Ở cỡ 28px, line-height 1.15 giữ các dòng gắn kết chặt chẽ. Định luật gần gũi Gestalt nhóm chúng thành một khối thông tin rõ ràng.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The inverse line-height rule: large headlines require tight leading (1.1–1.25), while small body text needs room to breathe (1.5–1.7).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Quy tắc dãn dòng nghịch đảo: tiêu đề to cần line-height hẹp (1.1–1.25), trong khi đoạn văn chữ nhỏ cần khoảng thở thoáng đãng (1.5–1.7).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .prl { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .prl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .prl-card { background: var(--bg-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; }
  .prl-card.is-correct { border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); }
  .prl-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .prl-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .prl-badge-wrong { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: var(--red); }
  .prl-badge-correct { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: var(--green, #10b981); }
  .prl code { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
  
  .prl-box { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; min-height: 105px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .prl-h3 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0; }
  .prl-lead-loose { line-height: 1.75; }
  .prl-lead-tight { line-height: 1.15; }
  
  .prl-desc { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-body); }
  .prl figcaption { margin-top: 0.8em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
